{"type":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-09-15T07:44:28.315Z","message":{"id":"msg_011Cf4rHB3GxBYZZG5n7qxgm","model":"claude-opus-5","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VTeuK9XP32VJT9S9N18ygD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/ct/Desktop/hygen/projects/molasses-flood-en/project.json","content":"{\n  \"id\": \"molasses-flood-en\",\n  \"title\": \"Boston, 1919: a 35 mph wave of molasses\",\n  \"status\": \"draft\",\n  \"concept\": \"- Настроение: чёрно-белый январский Бостон 1919 года, холодная гавань и эстакада — и в этом сером мире тёмно-янтарная, почти сладкая волна. Спокойно, без сенсации: странность — в самом веществе.\\n- Ключевой цвет: янтарь патоки на холодной серой земле (акцент #C8862E, земля #0E0C0A, текст #EEE8DE; холодный тон — сталь #9FB3C4).\\n- Look: свой объект `molasses-amber` поверх `abyss` — янтарный акцент (≈ 34°), одна текстура `fog` (холодная гавань, фон): набор {fog} не совпадает ни с одним роликом; типографика typewriter (газета 1919), лёгкий bloom, переход на ударе `film-burn`; субтитры calm · plain.\\n- Арка: story × shocking-statistic × object × what-remains. Протагонист — резервуар: полный, тёплый день, разрыв, волна, погибшие, и то, что осталось, — запах.\",\n  \"format\": \"1080x1920\",\n  \"fps\": 30,\n  \"language\": \"en\",\n  \"style\": \"documentary-dark\",\n  \"look\": {\n    \"extends\": \"abyss\",\n    \"id\": \"molasses-amber\",\n    \"name\": \"Янтарь патоки\",\n    \"about\": {\n      \"mood\": \"A grey January harbour in 1919 black-and-white photographs, and through it a dark amber, almost sweet wave; calm and strange rather than loud.\",\n      \"topics\": \"Industrial accidents and odd disasters of the early 20th century told through archival photographs.\",\n      \"avoid\": \"Fire palettes, neon, fast handheld shake, sensational type.\"\n    },\n    \"palette\": {\n      \"accent\": \"#C8862E\",\n      \"secondary\": \"#9FB3C4\",\n      \"groundTint\": \"#0E0C0A\",\n      \"temperature\": \"warm\",\n      \"textColor\": \"#EEE8DE\"\n    },\n    \"textures\": [\n      { \"id\": \"fog\", \"density\": 0.35, \"speed\": 0.3, \"color\": \"ashLight\", \"opacity\": 0.25, \"depth\": \"bg\" }\n    ],\n    \"motion\": {\n      \"camera\": { \"preset\": \"none\" },\n      \"parallax\": { \"enabled\": false },\n      \"type\": { \"number\": \"count-roll\", \"title\": \"typewriter\", \"label\": \"typewriter\" },\n      \"post\": [ { \"id\": \"bloom\", \"strength\": 0.2 } ]\n    },\n    \"transitions\": { \"default\": \"hard-cut\", \"hit\": \"film-burn\" },\n    \"grain\": 1.1,\n    \"vignette\": { \"alpha\": 0.64, \"clear\": 52 },\n    \"sound\": { \"hit\": \"deep-boom\", \"whoosh\": \"smoke\" }\n  },\n  \"voice\": { \"provider\": \"elevenlabs\" },\n  \"arc\": {\n    \"structure\": \"story\",\n    \"hook\": \"shocking-statistic\",\n    \"protagonist\": \"object\",\n    \"ending\": \"what-remains\",\n    \"why\": \"The tank is the protagonist: 2.3 million gallons, a warm day, a burst, a 35 mph wave, 21 dead — and what it left behind is a smell the North End kept for decades.\"\n  },\n  \"beats\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"01-tank\",\n      \"role\": \"hook\",\n      \"text\": \"[2.3 million|Two point three million] gallons of molasses sat in one steel tank in Boston, January [1919|nineteen nineteen].\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит руины 1919 года с красным контуром резервуара 50 × 90 ft и над ними счётчик «2.3M · GALLONS OF MOLASSES».\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.5],\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"src\": \"media/tank-scale.png\", \"fit\": \"contain\", \"treatment\": \"film-memory\" },\n      \"devices\": [\n        { \"type\": \"data.count\", \"target\": { \"x\": 50, \"y\": 21 }, \"at\": \"two\",\n          \"params\": { \"from\": 0, \"to\": 2.3, \"format\": \"decimal1\", \"suffix\": \"M\", \"label\": \"GALLONS OF MOLASSES\", \"size\": \"hero\", \"countDur\": 1.2 },\n          \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n      ],\n      \"dominant\": 0,\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"02-warm\",\n      \"role\": \"setup\",\n      \"text\": \"The day before, the air had warmed from [2|two] to [41|forty-one] degrees, and a fresh load of warm molasses went in.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит на тёмном янтарном фоне, как счётчик температуры ползёт от 2 °F до 41 °F — за один день перед катастрофой.\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.5],\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"color\", \"color\": \"night\", \"glow\": true },\n      \"devices\": [\n        { \"type\": \"data.count\", \"target\": { \"x\": 50, \"y\": 40 }, \"at\": \"warmed\",\n          \"params\": { \"from\": 2, \"to\": 41, \"suffix\": \"°F\", \"label\": \"THE DAY BEFORE\", \"size\": \"hero\", \"countDur\": 1.3 },\n          \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n      ],\n      \"dominant\": 0,\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"03-burst\",\n      \"role\": \"turn\",\n      \"text\": \"Just after noon, the tank burst. Its rivets shot out with a sound like a machine gun.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит свёрнутый стальной лист резервуара у опор эстакады, рукописная обводка подписывает его TANK STEEL.\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.6],\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"src\": \"media/el-structure.jpg\", \"fit\": \"contain\", \"treatment\": \"film-memory\" },\n      \"devices\": [\n        { \"type\": \"annotate.label\", \"target\": { \"x\": 60, \"y\": 46, \"w\": 29, \"h\": 14 }, \"at\": \"burst\",\n          \"params\": { \"text\": \"TANK STEEL\", \"sub\": \"DRIVEN INTO THE ELEVATED\", \"side\": \"top\" },\n          \"explains\": \"this curled riveted sheet is a piece of the burst tank thrown against the elevated railway\",\n          \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n      ],\n      \"dominant\": 0,\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"04-wave\",\n      \"role\": \"peak\",\n      \"text\": \"A wave [25|twenty-five] feet high swept through the North End at [35|thirty-five] miles an hour.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит главную фотографию — разрушенную Commercial Street с толпой и машинами, камера чуть дышит, наверху падает «35 · MILES PER HOUR».\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.7],\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"src\": \"media/aftermath-panorama.jpg\", \"fit\": \"cover\", \"focus\": [0.5, 0.5], \"treatment\": \"film-memory\" },\n      \"devices\": [\n        { \"type\": \"data.count\", \"target\": { \"x\": 50, \"y\": 13 }, \"at\": \"north\",\n          \"params\": { \"from\": 0, \"to\": 35, \"label\": \"MILES PER HOUR\", \"size\": \"hero\", \"countDur\": 1.2 },\n          \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n      ],\n      \"dominant\": \"stage\",\n      \"camera\": { \"reason\": \"tension\", \"amplitude\": 0.4 },\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"05-trapped\",\n      \"role\": \"aftermath\",\n      \"text\": \"As it cooled, it thickened and trapped those caught in it. [21|Twenty-one] people died; about [150|a hundred and fifty] were injured.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит 171 точку — всех погибших и раненых, и на слове «died» 21 точка гаснет.\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.9],\n      \"intent\": \"show-consequence\",\n      \"target\": { \"x\": 12, \"y\": 22, \"w\": 76, \"h\": 40 },\n      \"at\": \"cooled\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"count\": 171,\n        \"mark\": 21,\n        \"from\": \"spread\",\n        \"markAt\": \"died\",\n        \"label\": \"21 DIED · ABOUT 150 HURT\",\n        \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\"\n      },\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"06-smell\",\n      \"role\": \"ending\",\n      \"text\": \"The tank was never rebuilt. For decades, on hot summer days, the North End still smelled of molasses.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит, как тёмная патока медленно стекает с ложки, — тишина, без цифр.\",\n      \"pad\": [0.3, 2.4],\n      \"intent\": \"quiet-ending\",\n      \"data\": { \"src\": \"media/blackstrap-molasses.jpg\" },\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"fit\": \"cover\", \"focus\": [0.53, 0.5], \"treatment\": \"duotone\" },\n      \"dominant\": \"stage\",\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_Molasses_Flood\" }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"transitions\": [],\n  \"sound\": {\n    \"drone\": { \"peak\": \"04-wave:wave\", \"cut\": \"06-smell:start\", \"volume\": 0.4, \"carve\": 0.65 },\n    \"hits\": [\n      { \"at\": \"02-warm:start\", \"volume\": 0.4 },\n      { \"at\": \"03-burst:burst\", \"heavy\": true, \"volume\": 0.6, \"carve\": 0.75 },\n      { \"at\": \"04-wave:start\", \"volume\": 0.5 },\n      { \"at\": \"05-trapped:start\", \"volume\": 0.45 },\n      { \"at\": \"06-smell:start\", \"volume\": 0.35 }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"music\": { \"track\": \"documentary-dark-01\" },\n  \"publish\": {\n    \"titles\": [\n      \"Boston, 1919: a 25-foot wave of molasses moving at 35 mph\",\n      \"How did 2.3 million gallons of molasses kill 21 people?\",\n      \"The Great Molasses Flood: Boston's strangest disaster in 45 seconds\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"On January 15, 1919, a steel tank holding 2.3 million gallons of molasses burst on Commercial Street in Boston's North End. A wave 25 feet high swept through the neighborhood at 35 mph; as it cooled it thickened and trapped people. 21 died and about 150 were injured, and for decades the North End still smelled of molasses on hot summer days.\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"great molasses flood\",\n      \"boston molasses disaster\",\n      \"1919\",\n      \"boston history\",\n      \"north end\",\n      \"industrial disaster\",\n      \"molasses\",\n      \"strange history\",\n      \"massachusetts\",\n      \"history shorts\",\n      \"documentary\",\n      \"disaster\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":6136,"cache_read_input_tokens":148319,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6541}}}
